. * EXTRACT AND EXPORT RESULTS MEASURE 1 * 
. * Extract the required statistics
.                 * (i) coefficient estimate
.                 local coefficient_a = _b[treatment]

. 
.                 * (ii) standard error
.                 local se_a = _se[treatment]

